<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK OCT DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED NIL. [CORRECTED 07:28 GMT]</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK OCT DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED NIL. [CORRECTED 07:28 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland on Wednesday</p>
<p>revised the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month to nil from 4.29 billion markka announced</p>
<p>earlier.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Nov 1			 1,600</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Nov		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to Oct 29			   7,129</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    nil</p>
<p>(Corrects daily liquidity need to nil from 4.29 bln markka)</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
